   "Description notes that \"the subtests share one chain, so each starts from whatever the previous one left behind, and the caller has to patch Tip()->nHeight between them.\"",
   "Commit message notes that mining the 110-block chain in each test case is cheap because \"the blocks use hardcoded nonces.\""
