  "card": "Splits the monolithic CreateNewBlock_validity miner unit test into four independent test cases and eliminates state shared across test sections. Subtests previously shared an in-memory blockchain and required manual Tip()->nHeight decrements between runs, while basic mining checks repeatedly mutated a single transaction instance across assertions. Each test case now mines its own 110-block chain via a shared helper with hardcoded nonces, and transactions are constructed declaratively in place. The change touches only miner unit tests.",
